{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50253","headline":"题麻姑山庙 · 李翔","name":"题麻姑山庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"险翠峨霄压上游，大仙曾向此幽求。\n云埋三级坛空在，月照千寻水自流。\n偃盖鹤还清露滴，古池龙睡碧莲秋。\n桑田未必翻爲海，香火何人解继修。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}